children\":[\"American Bullfrog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"53\",{\"href\":\"/animal/amazon-river-dolphin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Amazon River Dolphin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"77\",{\"href\":\"/animal/anatolian-leopard/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Anatolian Leopard\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"98\",{\"href\":\"/animal/andean-cock-of-the-rock/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Andean Cock-of-the-Rock\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"129\",{\"href\":\"/animal/aardwolf/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Aardwolf\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Small birds have played remarkable roles in human history and culture that few people appreciate. Canaries accompanied miners underground for decades, their sensitivity to carbon monoxide and other toxic gases saving countless human lives. A canary named Miner or Guardian honors this life-saving partnership. Budgerigars hold the Guinness World Record for largest vocabulary among birds, with one budgie named Puck documented as knowing over 1,700 words. This extraordinary linguistic ability, rivaling much larger parrots, deserves recognition through names celebrating intelligence and communication skills.\"]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Do parakeets and small birds learn their names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Small birds, especially budgerigars and cockatiels, absolutely learn their names with consistent use. Budgies in particular rival larger parrots in their ability to recognize and respond to names. Using the name during feeding, training, and positive interactions accelerates learning significantly.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are the best names for a pair of budgerigars?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Budgie pairs suit complementary names: Kiwi and Mango, Sky and Sunny, Pebble and Pip, Zig and Zag, Salt and Pepper, Blue and Gold. Paired names celebrate their social nature. Budgies should never be kept alone and thrive with companion birds whose names complement their own.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I name my bird based on color if I don't know the gender?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Color-based naming works perfectly for birds whose gender may be unknown. Most small bird species are not sexually dimorphic in ways obvious to new owners. Color names like Sky, Sunny, Ash, and Pearl remain gender-neutral while describing your bird's most visible characteristic.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I name my finch if it lives in a large aviary group?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Finches in groups still benefit from individual names, especially if they have distinguishing markings. Use names that reference their specific coloration or behavior. In large aviaries, names help owners track individual birds' health and behavior patterns over the birds' lifetimes.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are good names for talking budgerigars?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Talking budgies inspire names celebrating their vocal abilities: Echo, Chatter, Gabby, Linguist, Professor, and Orator. The world record for budgie vocabulary exceeds 1,700 words, making these tiny parrots genuinely impressive communicators deserving of names that honor their remarkable linguistic abilities.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"parrot\",{\"href\":\"/animal/parrot/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦜\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Parrot\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"cockatiel\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cockatiel/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all